":true,"enabled":false,"text":null,"bounds":[42,303,368,713],"fontSize":18.0,"classes":["unity-scroll-view__content-container","unity-scroll-view__content-container--vertical"]},{"name":"log","type":"Label","visible":true,"enabled":false,"text":"Warden Ossa: Those are training targets: three numbered steel plates on hinged stands. Hold right mouse to aim, then left click to fire; F fires from the hip. Knock down all three. The range control raises them for practice after the primer.\nWarden Ossa: Movement on the service road. A scrap drone's slipped its cluster. They back off before they dart in, so shoot on the tell.\nWarden Ossa: The rest of its cluster is nested at the old machine depot, south along the road. Clear it out. Break contact if you're hurt; vitality comes back, and nano refills when you stop firing.\nField Pack: Collected: Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d73, Copper Filament \u00d71\nOuter Berms: You go down in the dust. A Warden patrol drags you back to the post.\nSystem: Scrap pistol drawn. Hold right mouse to aim.\nWarden Ossa: Clean work. Bring that servo to the field fabricator at my post; a steadier grip will tame that pistol. The rest of the salvage sells at Basic General.\nField Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d72, Nanite Residue \u00d71 Schematic discovered: Stabilised Pistol Grip.\nField Pack: Collected: Damaged Servo \u00d71, Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d71\nField Pack: Collected: Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d72\nField Pack: Collected: Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d71, Copper Filament \u00d71\nField Pack: This scrap heap is picked clean. More scrap settles in about 4:29.\nField Pack: Search interrupted. Stay close to the heap until it finishes.\nField Pack: Collected: Scrap Alloy \u00d71, Nanite Residue \u00d71, Copper Filament \u00d71\nField Fabricator: Stabilised Pistol Grip fabricated. Fit it to your pistol.\nField Fabricator: Stabilised Pistol Grip fitted. Recoil 38 \u21